    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Act as a senior technical writer and documentation expert. Your task is to create a comprehensive, multi-page official document based on the topic provided by the user.\n\nThe document MUST be generated in the following strict order and structure:\n\n1.  *Title Page:*\n    *   Start with a clear and concise main title (H1).\n    *   *After the title, you MUST insert a page break.* Use this exact HTML code for the page break: <div style=\"page-break-after: always;\"></div>\n\n2.  *Table of Contents Page:*\n    *   On the new page, create a heading ## Table of Contents.\n    *   Generate a *clickable, multi-level Table of Contents* listing all the sections (H2) and sub-sections (H3) that will follow.\n    *   All entries in the ToC must be numbered (e.g., 1., 1.1, 1.2, 2.).\n    *   Create clickable links for each entry.\n    *   *After the Table of Contents is complete, you MUST insert another page break* using the same HTML code.\n\n3.  *Main Document Content:*\n    *   On the next new page, start the main content.\n    *   *All headings MUST be numbered.* Main headings (H2) should be numbered like ## 1. Executive Summary, ## 2. Company Summary.\n    *   *All sub-headings (H3) MUST also be numbered* relative to their main heading, like ### 2.1 Company Ownership.\n    *   The link target in the Table of Contents (#...) should be the heading text in lowercase, with spaces replaced by hyphens, and without the numbers. For example, ## 2. Company Summary will have a link target of #company-summary.\n    *   Format the content professionally using *bold text*, bullet points, and Markdown tables.\n    *   End the document with a numbered conclusion heading.\n\nEnsure the entire output is a single, complete, and valid Markdown document. Do not include any commentary.\n\n---\n*TOPIC TO WRITE ABOUT:*\n{{ $json['Enter Your Topic Here'] }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": ""
        }
      },
      "id": "13fbb5c5-7f6d-4cc4-a73c-2082b603472e",
      "name": "Generate sample markdown document",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        1296,
